(text "J1 pins 1–3 connect to ESP32-S3 GPIO15/16/17 (BCLK/LRCLK/DATA OUT); pin 4 is GND." (at 18 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b62749da-774e-4b7a-9910-cffa015b715a"))
(text "J2 is the Adafruit #3006 MAX98357A: pins 1–5 are BCLK/LRC/DIN/5 V/GND. J4 supplies regulated 5 V and GND." (at 18 29 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "82d71b32-1b0f-4fbc-a526-79a03af9fecd"))
(text "J3 connects to the differential speaker outputs; LS1 is across both outputs, never to GND. See ADR-0010/0011." (at 18 36 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8f71799e-143a-45f8-b439-f04eb9464179"))
